The system succeeds when:

* customers receive fewer irrelevant interventions;
* re-engagement becomes more useful;
* customer feedback influences meaningful improvements;
* customer trust is preserved;
* recognition becomes more relevant;
* the platform learns from failure;
* customer silence is respected;
