5. Integration events crossing domain boundaries must be asynchronous.
6. Integration events must represent committed business occurrences.
7. Consumers must remain independent of publishers' internal implementations.
8. AI Agents must not become enterprise data owners.
9. The Trust Engine governs platform actions rather than customer worth.
10. The Learning Engine consumes evidence without replacing domain sources of truth.
11. Non-critical intelligence must degrade gracefully.
12. New cross-domain dependencies require architectural review.

