# 48. Intelligence Engine Observability

Each engine will eventually require observability across:

* latency;
* availability;
* accuracy;
* confidence;
* drift;
* cost;
* usage;
* failure rate;
* decision outcomes.

The Intelligence Layer therefore becomes observable as a first-class architectural subsystem.

